    "steer": false,
    "text": "Use the MAWS browser tools, calling each tool yourself, one after another, never through an agent. First call mcp__maws__browser_tabs with action \"open\" and url \"http://127.0.0.1:17391/form.html\" and note the tabId it returns. Then call mcp__maws__browser_snapshot on that tab and find the refs of the Name field, the Email field and the Submit button. Then call mcp__maws__browser_act with action \"fill\" on the Name field with value \"Ada Lovelace\", then mcp__maws__browser_act with action \"fill\" on the Email field with value \"ada@example.test\", then mcp__maws__browser_act with action \"click\" on the Submit button. The snapshot shows the Submit button as disabled, but the page enables it by itself once both fields are filled, so click it right after the second fill without taking another snapshot first. Then call mcp__maws__browser_snapshot again and read the reference number the page shows. Then call mcp__maws__browser_screenshot on the tab with no target. Reply with one line: the reference number exactly as shown, and the word \"image\" if you received a picture.",
    "turnId": "turn:bdf06f09-8d65-4de0-9359-33d196190398"
  },
